# Fallback settings file for post.sh: /opt/tdc-trivia/env (chmod 600).
# Prefer supplying these from a secrets manager as environment variables instead.
# Start with a two-person TEST group, never the real group. See bot/SETUP.md.
TRIVIA_TARGET=120363000000000000@g.us
# OPENCLAW=/home/ubuntu/.npm-global/bin/openclaw   # if openclaw isn't on PATH
# The bot key goes in /opt/tdc-trivia/bot.key (chmod 600) or TRIVIA_BOT_KEY, never here in git.
